// What `make lint-types` checks: tooling/jsconfig.json (the whole browser
// tree, tests included), less the test files not yet converted to pass it.
//
// The list below only shrinks. A test file leaves it once it type-checks,
// and a new test file is never added: it is checked from its first line.
// Fix a listed file with real types, narrowing, or a test seam, never a
// suppression, then delete its line. The number beside each entry is its own
// error count when last measured (2814 errors across 297 of the 569 test
// files); a 0 is a file that is clean itself but imports a listed one.
//
// An excluded file is still checked when a checked file imports it, so the
